Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:09.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕组制作 仅供学习交流 禁止用于商业用途
Comment: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:23.02,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.53,op-jp,,0,0,0,,緊急事態みたいだレスキュー
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.24,op-jp,,0,0,0,,僕ら彷徨うわバッドサイレンス
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.58,op-jp,,0,0,0,,会いたい人がいる天国
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.29,op-jp,,0,0,0,,そっから僕たちはどう見える
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.71,op-jp,,0,0,0,,何もかもおかしい時代で
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.25,op-jp,,0,0,0,,ぎりぎりを踏み外さないで
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.01,op-jp,,0,0,0,,しっかり手を繋いでいて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:57.51,op-jp,,0,0,0,,抱きしめる心許ない形を
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:00.01,op-jp,,0,0,0,,青く燃やす炎は蜃気楼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.51,op-jp,,0,0,0,,手に増やす土産話を
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:06.89,op-jp,,0,0,0,,君を思えば僕は
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:07.52,op-jp,,0,0,0,,飛べ！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.11,op-jp,,0,0,0,,はじまりはそうだ　あくまでもいいからベイベー
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.52,op-jp,,0,0,0,,手を貸して
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.07,op-jp,,0,0,0,,責めるほど増えるヘイト
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:17.39,op-jp,,0,0,0,,終われないんだよここで　
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:22.37,op-jp,,0,0,0,,今僕が選ぶのはいつかで終わらぬ証明　venez m'aider
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:25.15,op-jp,,0,0,0,,守りたい　見てみたいのは
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:29.71,op-jp,,0,0,0,,絶やさない鼓動　未来への応答
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:45.31,op-jp,,0,0,0,,緊急事態みたいだレスキュー
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:47.89,op-jp,,0,0,0,,僕ら彷徨うわバッドサイレンス
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.19,op-jp,,0,0,0,,会いたい君がいる現在地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:52.24,op-jp,,0,0,0,,今も聞こえるミュージック
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.16,0:05:39.53,op-cn,,0,0,0,,求救信号宣告情况紧急
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.24,op-cn,,0,0,0,,警告鸣响令人彷徨无措
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.58,op-cn,,0,0,0,,思念之人远在天国
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.29,op-cn,,0,0,0,,眼中的我们是何模样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:49.71,op-cn,,0,0,0,,在脱离常轨的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:52.25,op-cn,,0,0,0,,小心翼翼稳住脚步
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.01,op-cn,,0,0,0,,我们紧紧牵着手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:57.51,op-cn,,0,0,0,,抱作一团瑟瑟发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:00.01,op-cn,,0,0,0,,燃烧的青焰如海市蜃楼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:02.51,op-cn,,0,0,0,,回忆越来越多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:06.89,op-cn,,0,0,0,,只要为了你 我便无所不能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:07.52,op-cn,,0,0,0,,飞吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.11,op-cn,,0,0,0,,起初都是这样 是恶魔也无妨 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.52,op-cn,,0,0,0,,把手给我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:15.07,op-cn,,0,0,0,,越是苛责 越是憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:17.39,op-cn,,0,0,0,,不能止步于此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:22.37,op-cn,,0,0,0,,我们要选择的是永恒的证明 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.37,0:06:25.15,op-cn,,0,0,0,,想要尝试去保护的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:29.71,op-cn,,0,0,0,,不停歇的鼓动 给未来的回应
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:45.31,op-cn,,0,0,0,,求救信号宣告情况紧急
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:47.89,op-cn,,0,0,0,,警告鸣响令人彷徨无措
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.19,op-cn,,0,0,0,,思念的你就在此处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.19,0:06:52.24,op-cn,,0,0,0,,音乐依旧回响不止
Comment: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:05.05,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:19.62,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}描き出したストーリーが2人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:26.36,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}交わらせた意味は 未だにわからない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.93,0:22:30.67,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}そばにいてもひとりみたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:37.21,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}いつの間に僕らは 離れてしまったの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:45.06,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}誰にも 見せぬまま 言えぬまま
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.82,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}心は荒れ模様
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:57.86,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}君の綺麗な 声が 祈りが
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:23:03.36,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}僕の胸暴いて しまうからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:08.89,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}君の綺麗な 愛が 命が
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:14.38,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}僕の目貫いて しまえばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:20.39,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}ただ生きてていいんだって 笑うから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:19.62,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}故事之中 是两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:26.36,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}至今仍不明白 为何会相识
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.93,0:22:30.67,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}即使相伴 依旧孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.67,0:22:37.21,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}不知不觉中 我们渐行渐远
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:45.06,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}不愿向人展露 不愿对人倾诉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.82,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}内心乱作一团
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:57.86,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}你那柔美的声音与祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:23:03.36,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}将我的内心 揭露无遗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.36,0:23:08.89,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}你那绚丽的爱与生命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.89,0:23:14.38,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}只希望它们 贯穿我的眼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:20.39,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我会笑着说 你只要活着就好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:05.99,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\fad(1061,934)\shad3\bord0.1\an3\fs60\pos(1833.34,925.33)}第12集{\fsp3}「诀别」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\shad3\bord0.1\fs50\b1\pos(960,786.18)}下集{\fs30}\N\N{\fs60\fsp3}「狮郎与尤莉」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.15,0:00:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,为了让我们逃走 大家都来帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去坐电车尽可能跑远
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,到末班车的终点找旅馆住下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有话之后再说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.87,0:00:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你早晚会来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到来得这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么每次都要来帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明明是同样的出身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道不想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那只眼睛的真相 以及你出生的秘密吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这些真相能给予你力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,奥村老师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你在这里已经待不下去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,志摩？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.55,0:01:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你少开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男怎么可能会去启明结社
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.72,0:01:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我能给予你力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.46,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥 最后告诉你一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:02:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,正十字骑士团和启明结社并没有区别
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,梅菲斯特曾经为了制造恶魔的容器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,使用了大量活人做实验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,更有甚之 启明结社就是骑士团催生出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 爸爸就是实验中诞生的实验体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是被作为驱魔师培养出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的人 到底有没有人心都是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.03,0:02:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上 他抚养我们就是为了把我们当武器
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,把我们当道具
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,才没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.71,0:02:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我不知道老爷子的身世吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我所知道的老爷子…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他对你应该不一样 毕竟你很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但我很弱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是残次品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定嫌我很碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.79,0:03:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你…到底在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,很认真 很爱学习
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,个子很高 很懂事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.87,0:03:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很温柔 受女生欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但又很谦虚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,很聪明 长大想当医生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是老爷子和我的骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你在看什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把你那起了雾的眼镜擦干净 看清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你误会了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我去让梅菲斯特说出真相
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,无所谓了 我对这里没有留恋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我想变强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,奥村老师是不是举着枪？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.44,0:04:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.32,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他很认真…很爱学习…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而且很不服输
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不需要你的帮助了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不行…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,燐 小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,杜山诗惠美
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,正是关键时候呢 不要碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你让开 这样下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.55,0:04:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定…又是营养剂…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他这次是…动真格的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是…我到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底看了些什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 在我看来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥才是完美的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟不要吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,降魔剑…断了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我因为意外事件卧床不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,差点错过了最精彩的好戏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.45,0:07:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.67,0:07:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才砍向我的时候 剑断了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你这不是下得了手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不过很快就会恢复理智 还挺温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这就是你的极限
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那只眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,总算给你解开了那个可恨的束缚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,撒旦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见了啊 儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我时不时在看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏这个眼镜小鬼 我们总算能父子对话了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你控制了雪男？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我还是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,撒旦是独立的 在擅自说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等 等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,该觉醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,萨麦尔把你锻炼得挺好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,应该已经不是之前那个黄毛小子了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这具人类之身 差不多也能耐受住完整的力量了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,等你成功耐受住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那具身体就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟这是说好了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,小雪 不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不许妨碍父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 别遮住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 快把我带过去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小雪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道去了启明结社后会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我也会死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,万一我们两个都活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.16,0:09:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就会比你更强
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大伙再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,志摩…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,志摩…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,奥村 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有趣起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛 好痛 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,比那个时候痛得多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要输给力量了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,雪男
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,奥村…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他的身体…正在坏死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,兄长果然把奥村燐的恶魔心脏封印在了虚无界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,封印心脏的降魔剑断了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,所以恶魔心脏失去束缚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,彻底回到了奥村燐的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,虚无界之物要干涉物质界 就必须处于对等地位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,奥村燐的身体能否耐受住完整的力量呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要是没耐受住 会怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,会死掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.43,0:11:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我本想看看奥村燐够不够当父亲的容器来着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,结果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,也就那样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.44,0:12:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会…奥村…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能 肯定很快就会复活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是奥村燐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,燐…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔的心脏？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:12:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,燐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,诗惠美？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,奥村
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.63,0:13:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.39,0:13:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他是燐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但又不是燐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,小尼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,力量涌了上来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.65,0:13:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,杜山
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,植物构成了墙壁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那女人果然是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 如果是这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,森林？树丛？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,诗惠美做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,诗惠美好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好想毁了它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,它已经撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.91,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,奥村 你快醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好想把这力量全部放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.71,0:14:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是朋友 应该愿意接受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,燐在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.31,0:14:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你是…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你一直压抑着的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你就消失吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想杀死大家 我不能放任你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 我也不能放着雪男不管
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他是为了自己的目的 自愿离开的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.69,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别管他就是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是弱小的残次品 他肯定嫌我很碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么能让他留下那种话就离开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他错了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 那时我没能拿出自信这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我毫不知情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,胆小鬼到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,弱爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,又是想变温柔又是犹豫不决
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然还把我压制了这么久 想想就来气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍无可忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你压抑了16年的愤怒和欲望
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是力量本身
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,有力量才有权支配
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是理所当然吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.84,0:16:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我害怕了 我是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在逃避你 逃避过去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不弱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我的16年 是属于我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝对要保护好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这具身体不会交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.83,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这次就到这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你听好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,「我果然是撒旦之子 无法逃离这股力量」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是你自己说的 别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大…家…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,奥 奥村
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,杜山诗惠美
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.46,0:18:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.47,0:18:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,头发…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.92,0:18:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,姑且告诉你一声 其他人都没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,断掉的降魔剑也送到应去的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在是哪个奥村燐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,希望不是凶暴的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我也大病初愈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,梅菲斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我吧 我和雪男是怎么出生的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,撒旦的事 妈妈的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,老爷子是个怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:19:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我等的就是你这句话 奥村
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的你应当知道这些 做好心理准备了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快点告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须处理这边的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你一个人去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.00,0:19:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,去？去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,过去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该已经带在身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,通向过去的门钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,钥匙？什么钥匙…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 这是「神隐钥匙」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,能让持有者去往想去的维度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是独一无二的万能钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直带着的啊 怎么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,凡事都要讲时机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,1 2 3
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:19:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是饯别礼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,给你这身特务巡逻队的制服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,能进入几乎所有地方 并隐藏身形
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是我特制的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便再帮你把心脏藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,随便哪扇门都行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,先把门关上 插入钥匙再打开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,它就能把你带到想去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.65,0:20:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？怎么了 你害怕了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,当然害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,原本我是尽量不想知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,比起我 我更希望你能告诉雪男
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他很想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.88,0:20:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事我早就尝试过很多次了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 奥村老师应当接受的现实并不是过去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而你却应当接受过去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.93,0:20:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对方越想要就越不给 越不想要就越要给
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这个性格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你也太坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那是当然
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是恶魔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,少在这说废话 赶紧过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,棋子都开始去履行自己的使命了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.66,0:21:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,告别了短暂的和平
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.12,0:21:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「我们是如何诞生的」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,「父亲母亲是怎样的人」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,「我必须知道」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我等很久了 奥村
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,等你说出这句话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
